# Canopy clump (#236, forest-0 and forest-2 conversion): dark leaves along the room top, play layer, no collision. The hanging
# vines (HangingVine, 8x40, anchored at the room top) hang in front of it, so their background is one near-black foliage, not the
# moving sky, clouds and moon (the decor tier, D76, check_contrast.py). Three rows: two leaf rows and a lobed underside, opaque down to
# the vines' foot (local row 9 of the third row); a left cap, two middles and a right cap; row 0 repeats upward over the room top.
